W #* BEGIN ** RR
W =# BEGIN ~* RR
W == D ~* DS
D ** U =* US
U ** W ** RR

BEGIN _* CHECK ** DD
CHECK ** BACK F* LL
BACK +* FORWARD _* RR
FORWARD _* FORWARD ** RR
FORWARD F* STOP _* SS
BACK _* BACK ** LL
BACK =* BACKW ** LL
BACKW _* BACKW ** LL
BACKW =* BACKW ** LL
BACKW +* PRE _* DD
PRE ** LINE +* UU

LINE _* LINE ** RR
LINE =* LW ~* RR
LINE F* CHECK _* DD

LW _* LINE ** RR
LW =_ LINE ~* RR
LW == DL ~* DS
DL ** UL =* US
